              "originalPosition": 22,
              "body": "Should \"Event\" be included into the dialog context? Event can trigger the lifecycle state to change, like \"cancel/revoke\", it could be a term to be defined and included into the dialog context that needs to be propagated. ",
              "createdAt": "2026-10-12T04:24:15Z",
